			(property "Description" "microSD Socket for Transflash\n\nVarious sockets for µSD. tDoc lines correctly indicate media card edge positions when inserting (unlocked, locked, depressed).\n\nNOTE: CD1 and CD2 are connected internally, and the default detect state of the socket is detect pin to ground.\n\nSparkFun Products:\n\n• WAV Trigger\n• CAN-Bus Shield\n• SparkFun Level Shifing microSD Breakout"
